<title>SPAIN: Telefonica to pay a total 96 dividend of 89 pta.</title>
<headline>Telefonica to pay a total 96 dividend of 89 pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's telecom firm Telefonica said on Friday it would propose a total 1996 dividend of 89 pesetas, up 17.1 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The company's 1996 financial results allowed Telefonica to propose to shareholders a dividend payment of 89 pesetas per shares, a 17.1 percent increase over 1998&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;As part of this payment, shareholders will receive a complementary dividend of 54 pesetas per share at the beginning of June,&quot; the note added.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
